2. Relation to Existing Mathematics

We explicitly situate the framework within established areas. None of the following is claimed as novel:

Graph edit distance (GED). Minimum-cost transformation via edit paths. Exact computation is NP-hard; no PTAS exists unless P = NP. GED belongs to the family of quadratic assignment problems (QAPs). The LSAP relaxation provides a polynomial-time lower bound admissible for A* search.

Graph reconfiguration. Transformation between feasible configurations through feasible intermediate states. Many problems are PSPACE-complete, including NCL-reachability, independent-set reconfiguration, and shortest-path reconfiguration. Nondeterministic Constraint Logic (NCL) is PSPACE-complete even for planar graphs with restricted vertex configurations. Parameterized complexity by treewidth has been studied by van der Zanden.

Optimal switching with costs. Switching penalties produce hysteretic policies. The optimal control switches to one decision when the larger of two thresholds is crossed in the upward direction, and to the other when the smaller is crossed downward. The foundational mathematical treatment is Evans & Friedman (1979), who established existence and uniqueness of solutions to the Bellman equation for optimal stochastic switching.

Dynamic programming over discrete modes. Standard MDP theory. For succinctly represented MDPs, the finite-horizon policy existence problem is PSPACE-complete; this was established by Mundhenk, Goldsmith, Lusena, and Allender (2000).

Neural architecture search with cost penalties. Standard in NAS.

Mixture-of-experts routing. Dynamic token routing.

Self-adaptive systems. MAPE-K reference model.

Dynamic multi-agent LLM topology. AMAS dynamically selects task-specific graph configurations via lightweight LLM adaptation. GTD formulates topology synthesis as iterative graph diffusion. Graph-GRPO learns topology policies.

The framework's proposed contribution is the unified task-conditioned operational transition cost  C_T(s,s')  and its decision-theoretic treatment. Whether this constitutes genuine novelty remains to be established.

